title: "From Bioelectric State to a Falsifiable AC Impedance Pre-Test: A Technical Report on a Candidate Bioelectromagnetic Specification Generator"
abstract: "A technical report on a deterministic specification generator that maps resting membrane potential and boundary fractal dimension to a candidate bioelectromagnetic stimulus specification, with a proposed in vitro AC impedance pre-test. Not a scientific paper; no mechanism is claimed, and no clinical efficacy, safety, or validated-device claim is made."
